\newlabel{fig:age}{{5}{5}{The mandatory honesty plot: $N_{\rm SN}$ and $P(t_{\rm last} < 100\,$kyr$)$ as functions of a common assumed age applied to all three subgroups. Below \ageZeroBelow \,Myr the turnoff has not crossed the IMF ceiling and nothing has died; above it the count rises by roughly 12 supernovae per Myr of assumed age, reaching \NSNatSix \ at 6\,Myr. Everything this paper reports inherits the ages of Sect.~\ref {sec:imf}, and this is how that dependence is disclosed rather than absorbed}{figure.5}{}}
